# Loop screenshots (regenerable) — keep the dir, ignore the shots.
shots/*
!shots/.gitkeep

# Fetched CC0/CC-BY 3D assets (scripts/fetch-assets.mjs) — binaries never enter the public repo;
# the 3D cabin falls back to procedural materials/lighting when they're absent. Keep the credits.
public/assets/*
!public/assets/CREDITS.md
